+# Spec: Multiple `IncludeMappingConfiguration` attributes — V1
+
+Status: implemented
+
+## Objective
+Users want to compose a mapping's configuration from several reusable mappings (e.g. one per
+interface such as `IAudit` and `IOwnable`), including mappings on external mappers referenced via
+`UseStaticMapper` / `UseMapper`. Today `IncludeMappingConfigurationAttribute` is not declared with
+`AllowMultiple = true`, so a second attribute fails to compile (CS0579).
+
+## Assumptions
+1. The "infer derived mappers automatically" alternative is out of scope; only multiple includes are supported.
+2. Include order = attribute order; configs are merged the same way a single include is merged today.
+
+## New Behavior
+- `IncludeMappingConfigurationAttribute` has `AllowMultiple = true`.
+- All includes are applied (already supported by the generator).
+- A configuration that is reached through more than one include path (diamond) is not reported as a
+  circular reference; real cycles are still reported (RMG0xx `CircularReferencedMapping`).
+
+## Commands
+- Build: `dotnet build`
+- Test: `dotnet test test/Riok.Mapperly.Tests`
+- Format: `dotnet csharpier .` (repo formatter)
+
+## Project Structure
+- `src/Riok.Mapperly.Abstractions/IncludeMappingConfigurationAttribute.cs` — attribute
+- `src/Riok.Mapperly/Configuration/MapperConfigurationReader.cs` — include resolution
+- `test/Riok.Mapperly.Tests/Mapping/IncludeMappingConfigurationTest.cs` — snapshot tests
+- `docs/docs/configuration/reusing-mapping-configurations.mdx` — docs
+
+## Testing Strategy
+Verify-based snapshot generator tests: multiple includes from an external static mapper
+(interface-based, as in the issue), and a diamond include with no diagnostics.
+
+## Boundaries
+- Always: keep existing snapshots unchanged; follow repo style.
+- Never: change public API beyond `AllowMultiple`.
+
+## Success Criteria
+- Two `IncludeMappingConfiguration` attributes on one method compile and both configs are applied.
+- Diamond includes produce no diagnostics; circular references are still reported.
+- All existing tests pass.
+
+## Out of Scope (Deferred)
+- Auto-inferring reusable configs from `UseMapper`/`UseStaticMapper` — implicit behavior, larger design.
